==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Haniwanwan]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although the stage may seem threatening, it is actually really simple, especially if you already have good UL Mythics (such as [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Naala]] or [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]]). You also don't need to use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], since M. Ost will constantly knockback your units, preventing Haniwanwan from creating waves. LD Units are also recommended, to deal chip damage to Lowkey or Haniwanwan. And since the stage is time-based, you can use Worker Up Combos to make the stage easier (the best ones are [[Offshore Accounts (Combo)|Offshore Accounts]] and [[Don't Mess With Me! (Combo)|Don't Mess With Me!]]). After beating the stage, enjoy your Relic Orb!

One is also able to rush down Lowkey by using [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]] with good timing, leaving him with a sliver of health, enough to be finished off by the rest of your units.

